# A note of only colons has no text once they are dropped, so Enter adds nothing and the panel says "Type the text".
# BUG: the panel says "Enter adds it" and Enter adds an empty line under the project.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
END
keys qi <BS>
type :
see Type the text
keys <Enter> <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
END
